# Environment template for the readme-showcase optional vision-LLM review.
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE — copy it to `.env` in this same directory
# (skill/.env). skill/.env is the only place `.env` lives; the file is
# auto-created there with mode 0600 on first use.
#
# After copying, restrict permissions — this file may hold secrets:
#   chmod 600 skill/.env
#
# Process environment variables always win over values in skill/.env.
# Only keys prefixed `VISION_REVIEW_` are read from (or written to) the
# .env file; all values below are examples and must be replaced.

# Optional: API key for the vision-LLM review track. Leave unset to fall
# back to host-session review.
# VISION_REVIEW_API_KEY=

# Optional: reviewer model. Defaults to the host session's model when unset.
# VISION_REVIEW_MODEL=

# Optional: API base URL for the vision-LLM provider.
# VISION_REVIEW_API_BASE=
